.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH rev-stealth-config-paths 1  "rev-stealth-config-paths " 
.SH NAME
rev\-stealth\-config\-paths \- List each config file path (absolute), its existence, and permission bits (unix mode)
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBrev\-stealth config paths\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
List each layered\-config file path (absolute), its existence, and its unix permission bits. Useful for ops debugging 0600 / 0700 expectations.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help (see a summary with \*(Aq\-h\*(Aq)
.SH EXTRA
EXAMPLES:
  $ rev\-stealth config paths
  $ rev\-stealth config \-\-output\-format json paths

EXIT CODES:
  0  Ok               Paths emitted.
  1  UserError        Bad args.
  3  PermanentError   stat() failure.

ENV:
  REV_SCRAPING_HOME        Override `~/.rev_scraping/` base.
